# Vendor runtimes are user-supplied and must never enter the history. The staging
# directory is ignored wholesale; the globs catch a DLL dropped anywhere else.
Data/F4SE/Plugins/Fo4VRUpscaler/*
!Data/F4SE/Plugins/Fo4VRUpscaler/OpenXR/
Data/F4SE/Plugins/Fo4VRUpscaler/OpenXR/*
!Data/F4SE/Plugins/Fo4VRUpscaler/OpenXR/Fo4VRUpscalerOpenXR.json
!Data/F4SE/Plugins/Fo4VRUpscaler/.gitkeep
nvngx*.dll
nvngx*.license.txt
sl.*.dll
amd_fidelityfx_*.dll
ffx_*.dll
libxess*.dll
nvsdk_ngx*.h
nvsdk_ngx*.lib

# Reference clones belong outside the tree - see CLEAN_ROOM_PROTOCOL.md in the
# research repo. Anything matching these is a mistake, not a dependency.
*-reference/
